<title>SWITZERLAND: Danzas appoints new Eurocargo manager.</title>
<headline>Danzas appoints new Eurocargo manager.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danzas AG, the Swiss-based freight international forwarding concern, said it has appointed Walter Lehmann as its Eurocargo Division Manager Switzerland as of August 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Christoph Handschin, who headed the Eurocargo Division during the past months, will take over management of Danzas' Region East, Danzas said. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
